msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫What are you doing in here?!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫You can’t just go prancing into a boy’s "
"bedchamber!⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Leave that to the servants!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Cosa ci fai qui?!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Non puoi entrare nella stanza di un ragazzo come se "
"niente fosse!⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Lascia che se ne occupino i servi!"

#: scenario:scenario_B2CD5381_F8E4_4582_A964_B9A27FAF22C2
