msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫That was long ago.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Things are different now."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Era tanto tempo fa.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Le cose sono diverse, adesso."

#: scenario:scenario_EA83B011_92EC_4FBD_A5C8_E4DD58EDC6E6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1f364b8a651c85c8b4bd98ab92b4e156945638f03b4bb2a58726f36ab4eb68b7
