msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh, you’re overthinking it, silly.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Now hurry up—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫out of bed, "
"sleepyhead!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh, ci stai pensando troppo, sciocchino.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Sbrigati ora—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫fuori dal "
"letto, dormiglione!"

#: scenario:scenario_3BDEC31B_4982_4FF5_9ECB_5B5E1B0DD9E3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2db9dfe95b532f9b3a8d9ce87074a4f86a9ed1d28e2d99d359dc902a5a671d5a
