msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫All right, all right, I’m getting up.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫So you can see yourself out—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Va bene, va bene, mi sto alzando.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Così posso vederti fuori da—"

#: scenario:scenario_E1D0B631_CD63_4ADE_B1D1_58B1D2763E97
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a678daa89bcb3a3748b5a4dc09313399bf4ddd235cadfbc251d7ac789fe3bfa0
