msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Oh mio Dio, hai un aspetto orribile, caro Mell!"

#: scenario:scenario_5F7BF063_7788_4257_835D_D2C3D737A70A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: edb3a6e07447a95f974c26e79a0df465ee3b588d1193390e1f23af02aa9bddfb
