msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫For someone who overslept,⟪k:2⟫you look like you didn’t get a wink last night!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Per essere qualcuno che ha dormito troppo,⟪k:2⟫sembra che tu non abbia chiuso occhio!"

#: scenario:scenario_F6D5B2ED_5CF9_4699_84A9_D00BDB0FE885
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 150ded505b5b75852d771199c5f8d71a72117c0fae9cbb36b926cfbc5ae0b17f
