msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫T-⟪k:2⟫Tu dici?"

#: scenario:scenario_CA7AF55F_919F_44AE_AA6F_B113BFB2D8E2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9f2b5bb5ee314f000138a9640c47e777b9f8439967d12334745e7a8ef44fbe9c
