msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫At the time, the majority of "
"servants at the mansion were men."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫All’epoca, la maggior parte "
"dei domestici della villa erano uomini."

#: scenario:scenario_F2B800A9_E9C2_4FDB_BF00_BA9CE841C619
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 77da198fbfc3f47db71e7efdb42f841bdd822ab4fa1f7395869507102ce4672d
#. default-sha256: 2775166345ab2904a4b88adec9c60c7d5bd899f0ab8e72e4804080aca0e0f841
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_F2B800A9_E9C2_4FDB_BF00_BA9CE841C619"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫However, the ladies of the house all had abigails, so there were several women servants, "
"myself included."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Tuttavia, ogni signora di casa aveva delle ancelle proprie,⟪k:1⟫per cui c’erano diverse "
"donne come servitrici, inclusa io."

#: scenario:scenario_3EFDABD3_7A5E_425F_9145_E98B388782F0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aa00008c85991a838c94a5192652ec97b94167e5b9851f5efe273866e5d85586
#. default-sha256: ff89d61448ae7405bb770c1aeb203028d69419a0a68b26f559855d433c3bd58f
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_3EFDABD3_7A5E_425F_9145_E98B388782F0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The maids, by and large, were selected from the daughters of other esteemed families."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Le domestiche, di norma, venivano selezionate tra le figlie di altre stimate famiglie."

#: scenario:scenario_FA6A950A_915A_4A16_9051_F376D8BE7F12
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bd7be0b004a4f10690fff33ca52064146ef2913c1777d4054992dc6248722e17
#. default-sha256: 676c9f9234a0a4ae0dbc93c25ebb9fc2c192119872a6ad4710458bdbf6bf27b0
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_FA6A950A_915A_4A16_9051_F376D8BE7F12"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was, you could say, a sort of training before they entered society. ⟪k:1⟫The girls would "
"serve at houses even more powerful than their own."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Si potrebbe dire che era una sorta di addestramento prima di entrare nella società. ⟪k:1⟫Le "
"ragazze avrebbero servito famiglie persino più potenti delle proprie."

#: scenario:scenario_FA6A950A_915A_4A16_9051_F376D8BE7F22
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2001d51f198b8722fce85ee307633df14bc2f2824ec0cfb5514a8737bfc5f9a4
#. default-sha256: 3f5938b6ffb6700204aa2885cfbd6983f4c564d64b21cd087dd03742326e1d3e
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_FA6A950A_915A_4A16_9051_F376D8BE7F22"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And the White-Haired Girl Mell saw the night before was one such maid."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E la Ragazza dai Capelli Bianchi che Mell vide la notte precedente⟪k:1⟫era una di quelle "
"domestiche."

#: scenario:scenario_4C756A1D_7E40_4A70_A30D_C7B42458823E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 28c7f2920367a13f6e83fd3607c6fa85708973cc8aa9f5d041916f395b1cf4fe
#. default-sha256: 46f1c21f122acbae211cb363a7ebe8c4153848480e1c6ab6ebe178b02a9fcb62
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_4C756A1D_7E40_4A70_A30D_C7B42458823E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫When he heard this, Mell could not sit still any longer."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Non appena saputo ciò, Mell non riuscì a rimanere fermo."

#: scenario:scenario_E7159022_74E4_4DFA_A8B6_0C17FE1FAAA4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7d17e8b58d9d5e69af54efdab25813446d35ead00349143076c577cef716e5cc
#. default-sha256: 56b9473cdc5051c4b849a288e948790ddd53c1ac7710a85a9e7a807583a37f49
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_E7159022_74E4_4DFA_A8B6_0C17FE1FAAA4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh, ⟪k:2⟫uh, ⟪k:3⟫I didn’t really think this through, did I?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I don’t even know "
"where she is."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ahh, ⟪k:2⟫non ci ho riflettuto abbastanza...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Non so nemmeno dov’è."

#: scenario:scenario_75891131_002A_4F72_AA5A_6105623451E9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dc3a6277c42d6cb4d936bad23a270d6fd46a0e99434e2815c869a5da01725f08
#. default-sha256: 2e36b839476889e1bae4ff6522b0f86d6c98c6fe1762b7469a6595e9249b4766
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_75891131_002A_4F72_AA5A_6105623451E9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I’m guessing... ⟪k:1⟫she’s probably Mother’s maid."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Suppongo... ⟪k:1⟫che sia la servitrice di mia Madre."

#: scenario:scenario_21B0DC95_3B17_4F5E_892D_C8EF108B7123
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f53f0ffb6dafd9dd434886f4379a514236a282503c9e3339a6ab0a20ed163a1a
