msgid "⟪k:0⟫(It ⟪k:1⟫has⟪k:2⟫ to be the girl from last night.)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(⟪k:1⟫Deve⟪k:2⟫ essere la ragazza della scorsa notte.)"

#: scenario:scenario_12F10EE7_653F_4103_AE62_E833FAF60AFB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5182af94eedd5aca3c7681e1e994b1140f1804af68bd8f2177803b90e338e594
