msgctxt "scenario:scenario_12F10EE7_653F_4103_AE62_E833FAF60AFB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(But...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(Però...)"

#: scenario:scenario_C7F5FC13_B625_44CA_8578_533EFFADC3C5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c8baae8e214cedd19c5003c85486236dfad0aca19b21eeebd72b34a0a507beca
#. default-sha256: d76915c754327cdbad8b4c0bc4f4a50820891e6121528b47fbb3830804b04c42
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_C7F5FC13_B625_44CA_8578_533EFFADC3C5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Deep down, he was having difficulty believing the young woman he had seen the previous night "
"was truly here to be a servant."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Dentro di sé, aveva difficoltà a credere che la giovane che aveva visto quella notte fosse "
"davvero lì per fare da domestica."

#: scenario:scenario_64F00BBE_7B8D_46C5_B568_8BD153322816
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7e3a09f84d4eeffef55d0c59917079d6adbc9875c91b81d1bc6f8a4060c55b0b
#. default-sha256: 2a280daa0cbf5f160eac29f8e8a7f37dd0760286a6cc6aabaef303974cfbb469
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_64F00BBE_7B8D_46C5_B568_8BD153322816"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And can you blame him? ⟪k:1⟫When he saw her, she was an absolute mess—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫hardly what "
"you would envision from a girl of class."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E come lo si poteva biasimare?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Quando l’aveva vista, era in condizioni pietose—⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫qualcosa che difficilmente ci si aspetterebbe da una ragazza di classe."

#: scenario:scenario_64F00BBE_7B8D_46C5_B568_8BD153322817
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 89405cb970953bec011283a5f70be094db34b4aeb9f323babb069bfb0dcbc21e
#. default-sha256: fd7a0c127baaa867826078843947f80be94e76d915916486ffecd87e50380d1e
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_64F00BBE_7B8D_46C5_B568_8BD153322817"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But he did not seek her to find out whether that was true."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ma non era per scoprire se fosse vero o meno che si mise a cercarla."

#: scenario:scenario_E23E4733_2ACA_4DDB_A0D9_7473C5EB1513
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 753358c540bbc4ae7ab9167637f68660d5b46ff5f9b3a00316115c772155d10e
#. default-sha256: 1e695b9d81aec4b8465c030949b1f23ccbdaba0505713da81daa0e50f9865310
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_E23E4733_2ACA_4DDB_A0D9_7473C5EB1513"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He merely wanted to see her once more, to ascertain whether what he had witnessed the "
"previous night was real or his imagination."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Voleva solo vederla ancora una volta, accertarsi se ciò che aveva visto fosse reale o solo "
"frutto della propria immaginazione."

#: scenario:scenario_95D0836D_86AD_49F2_9127_9E559A901A1A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e5207ef6b19daae4a57670ecf134c8d85831a7a42abe719da2321fe303515043
#. default-sha256: a3f7ddb6dee9b100524c7b959c883f00b7d1fd5ed9638112bd2d44342706865f
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_95D0836D_86AD_49F2_9127_9E559A901A1A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And he wanted to have an actual conversation with her."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E desiderava avere una reale conversazione con lei."

#: scenario:scenario_793F2C06_1B67_4BFF_A7FD_ABCF4AED7CA0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a8ede28b19e841e2a7d4f0bca33c6eb745f6eef641fe210112a35b40aa4bbd6c
