msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫(I don’t want to run into Mother...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫That would be awkward.)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫(Spero di non incontrare mia Madre...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Sarebbe imbarazzante.)"

#: scenario:scenario_BBFAA974_0BC1_4BA9_A8EC_342DBD38A263
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8a4a016fc5a941367edad645df318ac6729d70e4e53fab108d3df2b05243b3ca
#. default-sha256: 944afe6656431b15a3aba0dbc934c4a9543b31d44713add6f5f672460cf8c88c
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_BBFAA974_0BC1_4BA9_A8EC_342DBD38A263"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫He was heading toward his mother’s bedchamber, but the closer he drew, the heavier "
"each step grew."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Si stava dirigendo verso la camera da letto di sua madre,⟪k:3⟫ma più si "
"avvicinava, più ogni suo passo si faceva pesante."

#: scenario:scenario_45C9FFB4_BD1C_4EBC_BB0C_D79162CF8C1B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 261b5d6fbda93919206cb9c127005f2ff131f2eda58f63af975408d334a915bf
#. default-sha256: 02c21f9c3e855a16fb82a8f83fa1994face9904936be101cf1d0787820f9a474
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_45C9FFB4_BD1C_4EBC_BB0C_D79162CF8C1B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫He rounded a corner, debating whether or not to head back—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫and stopped in his "
"tracks."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Girò l’angolo, mentre valutava se tornare indietro o meno—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫e poi, si "
"fermò di colpo."

#: scenario:scenario_C4254A1C_E1C8_46C3_9D6D_12E2701B4CC6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 135f9fefea3cfdc8ccc6386a596d9f3ac2f1cd463642e938d75e0b1e2f0e8875
#. default-sha256: 08b90584032dcfef041ec0be79dcccbdaeafae569c0dc691c27a2d79b3fab032
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_C4254A1C_E1C8_46C3_9D6D_12E2701B4CC6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫On occasion, wishes do come true. ⟪k:1⟫When Mell turned the corner, he saw her—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫the "
"same girl. That same white hair."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫A volte, i desideri si avverano. ⟪k:1⟫Quando Mell svoltò l’angolo, la vide—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫la "
"stessa ragazza. Quegli stessi capelli bianchi."

#: scenario:scenario_A2E3457C_E42C_40F9_AB04_2502779EA8A9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a9f7da1d63a0d851cc8d9c0ea4a16fe2a2b68c0f4dacbcbee1bbac0c31604985
