msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Ah..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Ah..."

#: scenario:scenario_B916317D_74AC_4EA2_8E2E_B2F35638D759
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a81d19de5f40a80676e3ceab9ae04b04aaf73e33970cbd86cc40578c12053b88
#. default-sha256: 612a68bd7570a9b318eaa638f066497c4a4841087ee4e9ee51d0f92056ff8485
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_B916317D_74AC_4EA2_8E2E_B2F35638D759"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She appeared to be cleaning the hallway."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Sembrava che stesse pulendo il corridoio."

#: scenario:scenario_FA0A544E_4C83_42E0_BFF9_76604B25257C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2645f14c180dc1ea3c9fce8fac65d5907355fe7e7586d651dd0af7b4ade485a5
#. default-sha256: 7e0e6dc1f9651989472664c0cd59538a7b17cbbad739654c685889ded90117ab
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_FA0A544E_4C83_42E0_BFF9_76604B25257C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She traced along the wooden carvings lining the walls, making certain not to miss even a "
"speck of dust."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Passava lungo gli intagli di legno sulle pareti, facendo attenzione a non perdere nemmeno un "
"granello di polvere."

#: scenario:scenario_F4AA069C_9C81_4A60_BBB7_CD74309760F3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3a59f8be848b450d3846a980aba2cc213ef233a964b48eb4c177518d5ba1b8ba
#. default-sha256: 210de6f0e0388ced27dbcb64fd087342114d73b140d447a4fc18a2a8db0f862c
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_F4AA069C_9C81_4A60_BBB7_CD74309760F3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The girl wore a pristine dress—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫the uniform of the mansion’s abigails. ⟪k:4⟫"
"There was no longer any filth to obscure her beauty."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫La ragazza indossava un vestito pulito—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫l’uniforme delle ancelle della villa. "
"⟪k:4⟫Non c’era più nulla ad oscurare la sua bellezza."

#: scenario:scenario_21F5A94F_8094_47C0_B9C7_13C9C3AAEDED
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 16c3b51f262a9e30511cb1c252f5bd2ed07c30cca34941ab32f1713b4b35a98b
#. default-sha256: 55b4d40cb1bcfba99800b6bf58a1219596a0693bafb16f7c71d6552d9c6fda22
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_21F5A94F_8094_47C0_B9C7_13C9C3AAEDED"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫All that had covered her pure-white hair and glasslike skin was no longer. ⟪k:1⟫The one "
"thing that had not changed was her listless ruby eyes."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Tutto ciò che le copriva i capelli candidi e la pelle simile al vetro non c’era più. ⟪k:1⟫"
"L’unica cosa che non era cambiata erano i suoi disinteressati occhi color rubino."

#: scenario:scenario_6BAFAE6E_9CFA_4034_B9CA_09A43E98FE76
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 65e71e7bd035fabc13f6585871b19ce141f5774578819ff1ea70d1745abfbadc
#. default-sha256: 800b98bad1c1421e9a757882587fe3715a209f46cfed2b7419cbca573de75086
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_6BAFAE6E_9CFA_4034_B9CA_09A43E98FE76"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Pardon me..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Perdonami..."

#: scenario:scenario_47C5578B_0D2C_474E_B7F7_8B251BC9A834
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c747d50d66bda2f1279537d060435cc1dfa9f5d67c6775f3c34d052d21b6fd82
#. default-sha256: 642cee80c264c8882a72cc24dec1183e8a5a7a8c122313dc09a45de88523a7eb
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_47C5578B_0D2C_474E_B7F7_8B251BC9A834"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Hearing his footsteps, the young woman raised her head. ⟪k:3⟫She caught Mell’s "
"gaze and for a brief moment merely blinked at him in silence."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Sentendo i suoi passi, la giovane donna alzò la testa.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Incrociò lo "
"sguardo di Mell, e per un breve istante si limitò a sbattere⟪k:5⟫le palpebre in silenzio."

