msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Everyone here truly has the most beautiful color of hair.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫...Did you have "
"business with the mistress, Lord Mell?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I can let her know, if you would like."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Avete tutti un colore di capelli davvero bellissimo.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫...Avete delle faccende "
"da sbrigare con la padrona, Lord Mell?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Posso farglielo sapere, se volete."

#: scenario:scenario_10FB6F9E_1F24_47D6_A109_E71AC1728D3D
